A change to krunkit 1.3.2. Licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0.

The option --free-page-reporting default|replace. A backport of krunkit PR #122
(https://github.com/libkrun/krunkit/pull/122, commit 9010731f8d), which is not merged yet.
The option calls krun_set_balloon_free_page_reporting_mode() of libkrun 1.19.8. With
"replace", libkrun replaces the free pages that the guest reports with new memory, and the VM
gives its free memory back to macOS. The default of libkrun is madvise(), which frees nothing
on macOS for memory that the guest wrote to.

The patch has only the src/ part of the PR, not docs/usage.md.

